# git-secrets allowed patterns — placeholder / test fixture / sanitization marker
# 这些 sk-... 出现是已知 safe 的:
#   - sk-your-...-here / sk-staging-placeholder / sk-e2e-placeholder = README + .env.example placeholders
#   - sk-test1234 / sk-ABCDEFG... / sk-ant-secret-key-12345 = 单元测试 fixture
#   - sk-ant-api03-abcdefghi / sk-proj1234567890 = leak_detector / sanitizer 自己的测试输入
# 任何真实凭据必须从 env 注入，不能 hardcode 在 source。
sk-your-[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+
sk-ant-your-[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+
sk-staging-placeholder[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*
sk-e2e-placeholder[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*
sk-test[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+
sk-ABCDEFG[a-zA-Z0-9]+
sk-ant-secret-key-[a-zA-Z0-9-]+
sk-ant-api03-abcdefg[a-zA-Z0-9]*
sk-proj[0-9]+[a-zA-Z0-9]*
ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxx[a-zA-Z0-9]*
# 测试 fixture for secret_scanner: ghp_<lowercase alphabet><uppercase A-F><digits>
ghp_[a-z]{26}[A-F]{6}[0-9]{10}
GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN.*xxx
Bearer sk-xxxxxxx[a-zA-Z0-9]*
Bearer invalid\.jwt\.token
